WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.260
That should calm him some.

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:17.892
Haku turned up one day,
just like you.

00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:21.021
He said he wanted to learn magic.

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:23.064
I didn't approve...

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:26.609
of him becoming
a sorcerer's apprentice...

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.529
I warned him,

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:31.448
but he wouldn't listen.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:35.076
Said he had nowhere left to go.
He signed up to be Yubaba's apprentice.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:38.705
As time went by,
he turned increasingly pale,

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:41.708
and his eyes took on a sharp gleam.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.714
Kamaji, I'm going to give this back
to Yubaba's sister.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:51.634
Give it back, apologize,
and ask her to help Haku.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.595
Tell me where she lives.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:56.389
Go to Zeniba's?

00:00:56.806 --> 00:00:58.725
She's one scary sorceress.

00:00:58.808 --> 00:00:59.601
Please.

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:03.855
Haku helped me. Now I want to help him.

